  [gate 23b] 10/10 contradictory prune configs REFUSED with ConfigError; 3/3 honest prunes accepted and their --no-* flags reach the soc argv
test_optional_blocks_reach_the_instance:
  [gate 23f] 8 real milan_soc.py elaborations of endstation_ax7101_1x1_tdm8, the shipping AX shape, in 7 s: each of the 7 --no-* flags lands as p_<PARAM>=0 in the Instance("milan_datapath") parameters and moves NOTHING else, a build that prunes nothing passes none of them (16 parameters, byte-identical top .v). Fabric gPTP's product default is graded separately by gate 1e. This grades what elaboration HANDS the module, not what the module DOES with it (gate 23d) and not that the bitstream places or boots
test_every_recipe_elaborates:
